    "3.7",
    "AIMMS (Advanced Integrated Multidimensional Modeling Software) model saved in a text format; contains an operations model created using the AIMMS modeling language; similar to an.AMB file, but saved as an ASCII text file instead of a binary file. Windows Paragon AIMMS. Any text editor Linux Paragon AIMMS. Any text editor. File used to open America Onlines instant messaging program; AIM may also refer to the AOL Instant Messenger program itself; the Windows executable is named aim.exe.. AOL discontinued Instant Messenger on December 15th, 2017. Windows AOL Instant Messenger Mac AOL Instant Messenger.",
