    "Password Pad Lite Document",
    "3.7",
    "Password-protected document created by Password Pad Lite, a text editor that incorporates lite encryption; stores encrypted document content so that the document can only be viewed with the correct password; used for saving sensitive personal information. NOTE: Password Pad Lite is the free version of Password Pad. However, it does not use as strong of an encryption scheme as the paid version, which stores encrypted documents using the.PWDP extension. Therefore, your information is encrypted more securely with the paid version. Mac Password PadFree.",
