    ".KLG",
    "KOFIA Log",
    "3.7",
    "Text file containing a log of events; saved by Sophos Anti-Virus and other applications. Mac Any text editor Windows Any text editor. Log file generated by KOFIA, a program used to analyze simulations on Unix systems. Linux KOFIA viewable with a text editor.",
