    "3.5",
    "Text document created by XYWrite, an early word processing program for Windows; contains plain text markup delimited by << and >> symbols. While XYWrite was commonly used in word processing and print media in the late 1980s and early 1990s, it is no longer are supported. Windows XYWrite Corel WordPerfect 2021. Any text editor.",
