    ".WPW",
    "WP Works Word Processor File",
    "3.5",
    "File saved by WP Works Word Processor, a program used for word processing; stores document text and document layout properties; can be opened in Corel WordPerfect. Windows Corel WordPerfect 2021. Developer file created by WinDev, an IDE used for developing Windows and mobile applications; saves a program window, which acts like a dialog box or output view for the final program; can contain text, fields, buttons, and other visual elements. While WPW files are used for mobile applications,.WDW files are used for desktop applications. Windows PC SOFT WinDev.",
