    ".OMFL",
    "Open Multiple Files File List",
    "3.4",
    "An OMFL file is a file list used by Open Multiple Files, a file-opening application developed by Vovsoft. It contains a plain text list of files, folders, and/or URLs that a user can open simultaneously using Open Multiple Files. OMFL files are created by selecting File → Save List Into File.. in Open Multiple Files menu bar. OMFL file open in Vovsoft Open Multiple Files Open Multiple Files is a Windows application that allows users to open multiple files, folders, and URLs simultaneously. To do so, users add files, folders, and URLs to Open Multiple Files Files, Folders, URLs list. The user then clicks the programs OPEN MULTIPLE FILES button to open all the items they added to the list. If a user expects theyll want to open the same set of items multiple times (for example, because they are working on a project that uses files stored in multiple folders), they can save that set as an Open Multiple Files file list, or OMFL file. To quickly open the set of files again, a user can load their OMFL file in Open Multiple Files and click the programs OPEN MULTIPLE FILES button. You can open an OMFL file in Open Multiple Files (Windows). To do so, select File → Load List from File.. from the programs menu bar. Then, navigate to and open your OMFL file. Windows Vovsoft Open Multiple Files. Any text editor Mac Any text editor Linux Any text editor.",
