    "Pages iCloud Document",
    "3.3",
    "Text document created by Pages, the word processor included with Apples iWork suite; used as the save format when a user chooses to save the document to iCloud; differs from the standard.PAGES extension, but doesnt affect the contents of the document when reopened in Pages. NOTE: Numbers spreadsheets in iCloud use the.NUMBERS-TEF extension, and Keynote iCloud presentations use the.KEY-TEF extension. Mac Apple Pages Included with OS. iOS Apple PagesFree.",
