    ["text_files",
    ".UTF8",
    "Unicode UTF8-Encoded Text Document",
    "3.2",
    "Text document that uses Unicode UTF-8 (8-bit Unicode Transformation Format) encoding; can be used for English and many other languages, including support for Asian characters; backwards compatible with ASCII. Windows Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Microsoft Wordpad Included with OS. Microsoft Word 365. gVim. Other text editor Mac Apple TextEdit Included with OS. MacroMates TextMate. MacVim. Other text editor Linux Vim. GNU Emacs. Other text editor.",
    "Windows Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Microsoft Wordpad Included with OS. Microsoft Word 365. gVim. Other text editor. Mac Apple TextEdit Included with OS. MacroMates TextMate. MacVim. Other text editor. Linux Vim. GNU Emacs. Other text editor.",
    "?"],
    ["text_files",
    ".WPT",
    "Kingsoft Writer Template",
    "3.2",
    "A WPT file is a text document template created by Corel WordPerfect, a word processor for Windows. It contains a pre-formatted document that may include text, drawn objects, charts, tables, and images. The primary purpose of WPT files is to allow users to quickly create multiple WordPerfect (.WPD) documents with similar content and appearance. WPT file open in Corel WordPerfect 2021 WordPerfect is available with the Corel WordPerfect office suite, which is similar to Microsoft Office. You can use the WordPerfect word processor in home, academic, and business environments to author various documents, such as reports, letters, invitations, resumes, flyers, and newsletters. While the proprietary Corel WPD document format is the main file type associated with WordPerfect, WPT templates are a helpful format when you want to re-use a document to create other documents with a similar layout or content. Examples of commonly used templates include company letterheads, business memos, legal forms, and mailing envelopes. You can open WPT files with Corel WordPerfect in Windows. The application is included with the Corel WordPerfect Office suite, along with the Quattro Pro and Presentations programs. To open a WPT file with WordPerfect, select File → Open.. You can also select File → New Template.. to open WPT files packaged with WordPerfect. Windows Corel WordPerfect 2021. A WPT file is a document template created by Kingsoft Writer, a word processor that is part of the Kingsoft WPS Office suite. It stores the page layout formatting and styles for a document and can be used for creating multiple Kingsoft Writer documents (.WPS files) with the same layout and text. WPT file open in Kingsoft WPS Office 2019 Writer comes bundled with several WPT templates and allows you to download many more directly through the application. They can be used for resumes, letterheads, weekly planners, newsletters, job descriptions, certificates, and other documents that are often replicated. WPT templates can also be converted to other spreadsheet files such as.DOT,.DOTX,.DOC and.DOCX files. The WPS Office suite is similar to the Microsoft Office suite but is available for free. WPS Office offers four primary tools that are accessible in one single module: Writer - Word processor similar to Microsoft Word Spreadsheets - Spreadsheet program similar to Microsoft Excel Presentation - Presentation program similar to Microsoft PowerPoint PDF Editor - Create a PDF file from scratch or from an existing file or open, edit, save, compress, or convert a PDF file Writer features rich text editing and document formatting capabilities and comes with several tools including spell check, word count, thesaurus, and add-ins. Besides the WPS and WPT files, Writer also supports DOCX, DOC, DOTX, RTF, and.PDF files. Android Kingsoft WPS Office for Android. Windows Kingsoft WPS Office. Mac Kingsoft WPS Office. Linux Kingsoft WPS Office. iOS Kingsoft WPS Office for iOS. Template created by Microsoft Works, a productivity suite for home users; contains pre-defined text, graphics, layout, and other document formatting information; used for creating multiple new.WPS files. Microsoft Works includes many pre-built templates that users can select from in the program. Users can also make custom templates and store them in WPT files. Windows Microsoft Works —  (Discontinued). Game data file used by games developed with the Cube 2 first-person shooter (FPS) engine; stores locations, or waypoints, within a game map; used for marking safe locations and pathways that artificial intelligence players, or bots, can move to. Waypoints can be linked in series with other waypoints so that bots follow pre-defined paths within a map. To create a WPT file, users can enter the Cube 2: Sauerbraten waypoint mode and walk through a game map, marking locations as they move. NOTE: Cube 2 is a free cross-platform game engine that was released in 2004. Windows Cube 2: Sauerbraten. Mac Cube 2: Sauerbraten. Linux Cube 2: SauerbratenFree.",
    "Windows Corel WordPerfect 2021. Android Kingsoft WPS Office for Android. Windows Kingsoft WPS Office. Mac Kingsoft WPS Office. Linux Kingsoft WPS Office. iOS Kingsoft WPS Office for iOS. Windows Microsoft Works —  (Discontinued). Windows Cube 2: Sauerbraten. Mac Cube 2: Sauerbraten. Linux Cube 2: Sauerbraten.",
    "?"],
