    "3.2",
    "Online document created by Naver Word, a Web-based word processing and productivity application; supports templates, stylized text, page formatting, tables, charts, and images; can be accessed through an NDrive online storage location. Web NHN Naver Word —  (Discontinued). iOS NHN Naver Ndrive —  (Discontinued). Android NHN Naver NdriveFree.",
