    "EasyWord Big Document",
    "3.0",
    "Document saved with EasyWord, the word processor included with the EasyOffice office suite; used for saving large files created with EasyWord; can also be exported to a.DOC file, which can be opened by Microsoft Word. EasyOffice is no longer developed and has been replaced by the ONE Office Suite. Windows E-Press EasyWord (part of EasyOffice).",
