    "2.8",
    "File created by Cyril Hicks; contains simple text; saved in a proprietary format and can only be opened by the.joe Editor; includes multiple features, e.g., it cannot be edited once saved, cannot be exported as a different file type, and cannot be chosen as a valid filetype or as a default type. Windows.joe EditorFree.",
