    "Word processing document created with Dagesh Pro, a Hebrew-English word processor; supports over 200 Hebrew True-Type fonts and spellcheck for 7 languages; may include formatted text, wrap around graphics, background graphics, tables, and many other objects. Windows TES Dagesh Pro. Screen saver project file created by 3D Screen Creator, a program used to develop 3D screen savers for Windows; stores 3D objects, cameras, textures, and fonts, as well as the screen saver animation timeline; used for storing scenes and exporting them as.SCR files or self-containable.EXE executable files. DGS files can be exported in 3D Screen Creator by selecting File → Export.. and then choosing the type (Screen Saver or Standard Executable) and the output resolution. There are several supported resolutions from 640x480 to 1600x1200. Windows DevSoft 3D Screen Creator.",
