    "2.5",
    "CAD file created by Robot Structural Analysis, a program used for analyzing complex building structures; stores a 3D model of a building and can include materials and design codes; may be used for identifying structural strengths or weak points. Windows Autodesk Robot Structural Analysis Professional. Page layout file created by RagTime, a publishing application used for graphics design, prepress, and for other page formatting tasks; can include text, images, diagrams, spreadsheets, and other visual elements; can be output to PostScript or.PDF formats. Mac RagTime. Windows RagTime.",
