    "2.4",
    "Document that contains a text description of graphs of nodes and edges; written in the DOT language and can be read by Graphviz compatible software programs. NOTE: The GV extension was introduced to replace the previous.DOT extension, which is used for Microsoft Word templates. Mac Graphviz. Windows Graphviz. Linux GraphvizFree.",
