    "2.3",
    "Text file created for NoteWorthy Composer 2, a music composition program; contains code that can be used to generate a NoteWorthy Composer song (.NWC) file; includes page and staff formatting information as well as instruments, lyrics, and notes. Windows NoteWorthy Composer 2.",
