    ".BBS",
    "Bulletin Board System Text",
    "2.2",
    "Text stored and displayed by an online bulletin board system (BBS); typically a standard text file that can be accessed by users who connect to the bulletin board using BBS software. Windows BBS server software View with a text editor Mac BBS server software View with a text editor Linux BBS server software View with a text editor.",
