    "2.0",
    "Text document created with KWord, a frame-based word-processing and desktop publishing program; includes advanced page formatting options and uses paragraph style sheets to apply styles to text, tables, columns, borders, etc. KWord is part of KOffice, an integrated office suite for Unix and Linux-based workstations. Developed specifically for the K Desktop Environment (KDE). The KOffice suite is offered as a free download at KOffice.org. Mac KOffice KWord Linux KOffice KWord.",
    "Mac KOffice KWord. Linux KOffice KWord.",
