    "Text Document",
    "1.8",
    "File created in a plain text format, similar to a.TXT file; set as a default file association in Windows 7; can be opened with any text viewer. Windows Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Microsoft Wordpad Included with OS. Other text editor.",
    "Windows Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Microsoft Wordpad Included with OS. Other text editor.",
