    ".SCW",
    "Movie Magic Screenwriter Document",
    "1.7",
    "Musical score created with Score Writer or Score Writer 2 software; uses a simplified interface for creating arrangements for bands and small orchestras, as well as lead sheets, and choral parts for individual musicians. Windows GenieSoft Score Writer Mac GenieSoft Score Writer. Screenwriting project created with Movie Magic Screenwriter; can be used to write scripts for screenplays, television episodes, plays for stage, and novels. Windows Write Brothers Movie Magic Screenwriter Screenwriters PrintScript Viewer Mac Write Brothers Movie Magic Screenwriter.",
    "Windows GenieSoft Score Writer. Mac GenieSoft Score Writer. Windows Write Brothers Movie Magic Screenwriter Screenwriters PrintScript Viewer. Mac Write Brothers Movie Magic Screenwriter.",
